<%- content_for :title, "Northbolt — Smart locks for self storage" %>

<!-- Nav -->
<nav class="fixed top-0 inset-x-0 z-50 bg-white border-b border-gray-200">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 h-16 flex items-center justify-between">
    <%= render "shared/logo" %>
    <%= link_to "Sign in", new_user_session_path, class: "bg-gray-900 text-white hover:bg-gray-700 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold transition-colors" %>
  </div>
</nav>

<!-- Hero -->
<section class="pt-40 pb-24 px-6 max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
  <h1 class="text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-gray-900 leading-tight">
    Smart locks for self storage.<br>No wiring. No engineer.
  </h1>
  <p class="mt-6 text-xl text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
    A battery-powered, cellular lock that mounts on any storage unit door in 20 minutes.
    Tenants receive access automatically. Access is revoked automatically.
    You never touch anything.
  </p>
  <div class="mt-10 flex items-center justify-center gap-6">
    <%= link_to "Sign in to your dashboard", new_user_session_path, class: "bg-gray-900 text-white hover:bg-gray-700 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold transition-colors" %>
    <a href="#how-it-works" class="text-gray-700 hover:text-gray-900 text-sm font-semibold">How it works</a>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- How it works -->
<section id="how-it-works" class="py-20 bg-gray-50">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 text-center mb-14">How it works</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-10">
      <div>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">01</p>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Order and fit it yourself</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">The lock arrives in the post. Mount it with four screws in 20 minutes. No electrician, no controller box, no site infrastructure of any kind.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">02</p>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Access issued automatically</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">When a tenant is granted access, a 4-digit PIN is generated and sent to them by SMS and email. The lock receives it over cellular. No manual step required.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">03</p>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Access revoked automatically</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">When a lease ends or a payment fails, access is revoked. The PIN stops working. The operator never has to visit the site.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Features -->
<section class="py-20">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 text-center mb-14">Built for independent operators</h2>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <div class="p-8 border border-gray-200 rounded-xl">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">No site infrastructure</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Each lock contains its own cellular modem and SIM card. There is no hub, no mains wiring, and no dependency on site Wi-Fi.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-8 border border-gray-200 rounded-xl">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Works in poor signal</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">PINs are validated on the lock itself. Access works even when there is no live network connection at the moment a tenant enters.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-8 border border-gray-200 rounded-xl">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Long battery life</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">The locking mechanism draws power only during an access event. The dashboard gives you advance warning before a battery needs attention.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="p-8 border border-gray-200 rounded-xl">
        <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Complete audit trail</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Every access attempt is logged with a timestamp. View the full history for any lock or location from the dashboard at any time.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Pricing -->
<section class="py-20 bg-gray-50">
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 mb-4">Simple pricing</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-500 mb-14">One-time hardware cost. One flat monthly fee. No surprises.</p>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 text-left">
      <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-8">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Hardware</p>
        <p class="text-5xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 tracking-tight">£299</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2">per lock, one-time purchase</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-gray-900 rounded-xl p-8 text-white">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Subscription</p>
        <p class="text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight">£4</p>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mt-2">per lock, per month</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Footer -->
<footer class="py-10 border-t border-gray-100">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 text-center text-sm text-gray-400">
    &copy; <%= Time.current.year %> Northbolt. All rights reserved.
  </div>
</footer>
